### 가입
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "emailOrPhone": "hojun@example.com", "name": "정호준", "username": "hojun", "password": "hojun1234" }

### 로그인
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "hojun", "password": "hojun1234" }

### 지금 비밀번호를 틀리게 보내면
PATCH http://localhost:4012/me/password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "hojun0000", "newPassword": "hojun5678" }

### 비밀번호 바꾸기
PATCH http://localhost:4012/me/password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "hojun1234", "newPassword": "hojun5678" }

### 나는 누구 — 비밀번호를 바꾼 이 기기
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me

### 옛 비밀번호로 로그인
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "hojun", "password": "hojun1234" }

### 새 비밀번호로 로그인
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "hojun", "password": "hojun5678" }
